  "_comment": "FROZEN. Do not edit to make a red test green \u2014 find out what diverged. Companion to match-01: where that one plays a rounded match, this one exists for MASS SENDING. Twenty creeps bought on a single tick spawn in one call, which is the case the spawn queue used to make impossible and the along-path offset in spawnPointFor now has to handle alone. It is the highest-risk arithmetic in the send path and the fixture that would catch it drifting.",
